      "message": "fix(macos): accept echoed kevent receipt flags\n\nDarwin returns EV_ERROR plus the submitted flags for successful EV_RECEIPT registration and preserves EV_RECEIPT on the later NOTE_EXIT event. Preserve identity, errno, userdata, exit and cleanup checks while accepting those requested bits in the app and removal paths.\n\nAdd real Darwin receipt and exit-event regression checks with 28 refusal cases.\n\n[macos-desktop-update] [macos-builds-only]",
